WEBVTT

01:07:58.923 --> 01:08:03.666
and the possible implications
for the future of work for all of us.

01:08:03.690 --> 01:08:06.651
(Recording) Kai-Fu Lee: AI will be able
to do most of the jobs

01:08:06.675 --> 01:08:08.414
of 40 percent of the people.

01:08:08.438 --> 01:08:13.139
So I worry: Are we going to be able
to shift fast enough

01:08:13.163 --> 01:08:18.712
and prepare for this future world
in which the routine jobs are displaced?

01:08:19.100 --> 01:08:20.775
(Closing music)